{"id":"en_the-dragon-queen-can-hear-my-thoughts","title":"The Dragon Queen Can Hear My Thoughts","titleEn":"The Dragon Queen Can Hear My Thoughts","description":"Arthur, a construction executive, finds himself reborn as a humble human clerk in a realm governed by dragons. Dragon Queen Evelyn accidentally overhears his sardonic inner musings, which allow him to solve seemingly impossible trials and carve up the territory of rebels through a clever edict. As he climbs the ranks of a court that looks down on humans, this cheeky strategist grows into the keenest intellect protecting the dragon throne.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-dragon-queen-can-hear-my-thoughts/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-dragon-queen-can-hear-my-thoughts/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Karma Payback","Time Travel","Underdog Rise","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ditqo/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-dragon-queen-can-hear-my-thoughts_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ditqo/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-dragon-queen-can-hear-my-thoughts_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ditqo/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-dragon-queen-can-hear-my-thoughts_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ditqo/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-dragon-queen-can-hear-my-thoughts_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"http